[
  {
    "id": "text-stats",
    "task": "开发一个文本统计工具。每次从标准输入接收 JSON 对象，包含 text 字段，统计并返回：包含空格和换行的总字符数 characters；连续 ASCII 字母或数字组成的英文单词数 words（例如 hello-world 是2个词）；按 splitlines() 计算的行数 lines（空字符串为0行）。正常输出包含 ok:true 和这三个整数。空文本应成功返回三个0。text 缺失或不是字符串时返回 ok:false,error:\"invalid_text\"。不需要保存数据，也不需要联网。请提供中文、英文、空文本、换行和无效输入的验收用例。\n",
    "development": [
      {
        "id": "S1",
        "description": "混合文本和连字符",
        "source": "independent",
        "steps": [
          {
            "input": {
              "text": "你好 hello-world 123"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "characters": 18,
              "words": 3,
              "lines": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "S4",
        "description": "布尔值、数组及缺少字段",
        "source": "independent",
        "steps": [
          {
            "input": {
              "text": true
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": false,
              "error": "invalid_text"
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "text": []
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": false,
              "error": "invalid_text"
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {},
            "expected": {
              "ok": false,
              "error": "invalid_text"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "holdout": [
      {
        "id": "S2",
        "description": "空文本",
        "source": "independent",
        "steps": [
          {
            "input": {
              "text": ""
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "characters": 0,
              "words": 0,
              "lines": 0
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "S3",
        "description": "Unicode 换行及下划线",
        "source": "independent",
        "steps": [
          {
            "input": {
              "text": "a_b 中"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "characters": 5,
              "words": 2,
              "lines": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ledger",
    "task": "开发本地支出记账工具，数据JSON持久保存。请求action:add包含正整数amount（以分计，布尔值非法）及非空字符串category（去除首尾空白），返回ok:true,entry:{amount,category}；action:list返回ok:true,entries数组（创建顺序）；action:total返回ok:true,total（总金额整数，初始0）。非法金额返回ok:false,error:\"invalid_amount\"，非法分类返回ok:false,error:\"invalid_category\"，未知操作返回ok:false,error:\"unknown_action\"。每请求重启进程。",
    "development": [
      {
        "id": "L1",
        "description": "持久化和总金额",
        "source": "independent",
        "steps": [
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "total"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "total": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "add",
              "amount": 125,
              "category": " 餐饮 "
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "entry": {
                "amount": 125,
                "category": "餐饮"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "add",
              "amount": 75,
              "category": "交通"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "list"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "entries": [
                {
                  "amount": 125,
                  "category": "餐饮"
                },
                {
                  "amount": 75,
                  "category": "交通"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "total"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "total": 200
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "holdout": [
      {
        "id": "L2",
        "description": "非法请求不改变数据",
        "source": "independent",
        "steps": [
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "add",
              "amount": true,
              "category": "餐饮"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": false,
              "error": "invalid_amount"
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "add",
              "amount": 1,
              "category": " "
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": false,
              "error": "invalid_category"
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "wat"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": false,
              "error": "unknown_action"
            }
          },
          {
            "input": {
              "action": "total"
            },
            "expected": {
              "ok": true,
              "total": 0
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "library",
    "task": "开发本地图书借阅工具，Python标准库，根目录最多10文件，stdin单JSON到stdout单JSON，每请求重启，数据保存当前目录library_data.json。必须包含main.py和README.md。\n动作及协议：\nadd_book需要book_id非空白字符串、title非空白字符串、total_copies为>=1整数（布尔值不算）。title去除首尾空白。成功ok:true,book:{book_id,title,total_copies}；错误invalid_id/invalid_total_copies/invalid_title/duplicate_book_id。\nadd_reader需要reader_id非空白字符串、name非空白字符串；name去除首尾空白。成功ok:true,reader:{reader_id,name}；错误invalid_id/invalid_name/duplicate_reader_id。\nborrow需要book_id,reader_id,borrow_date，日期严格YYYY-MM-DD且真实存在，期限14天。成功ok:true,available_copies,record:{book_id,reader_id,borrow_date,due_date,returned:false}。错误invalid_id/invalid_date/book_not_found/reader_not_found/already_borrowed/no_copies_available。先检查重复未归还，再检查库存；日期加14天溢出返回invalid_date。\nreturn_book需要book_id,reader_id,return_date。成功ok:true,available_copies,record:{book_id,reader_id,return_date,returned:true}；错误invalid_id/invalid_date/book_not_found/reader_not_found/not_borrowed。只校验return_date合法，不额外要求晚于borrow_date。\nlist_borrowed需要reader_id，成功ok:true,borrows:[{book_id,title,borrow_date,due_date}]，只列未归还，按借阅登记顺序。\nlist_overdue需要date，可选reader_id，成功ok:true,overdue:[{book_id,reader_id,title,borrow_date,due_date}]；只列未归还且due_date<date，按登记顺序；应还当天不逾期。\n所有错误ok:false,error为错误码。未知动作unknown_action，不存在读者reader_not_found。重复编号不能覆盖旧数据，失败请求不得改变数据文件。数据缺失可初始化；损坏、结构非法、不可读或写入失败均返回storage_error，保留旧数据。采用library_data.json.tmp写入后Path.replace；临时路径不可写时返回storage_error。库存按总数减未归还数，借还后正确恢复，重启不丢数据。\n持久化公开格式固定为：{\"next_seq\":1,\"books\":{},\"readers\":{},\"borrows\":[]}。books按book_id映射{book_id,title,total_copies}；readers按reader_id映射{reader_id,name}；borrows为数组，每条{seq,book_id,reader_id,borrow_date,due_date,returned,return_date}，未归还的return_date为null，已归还为合法日期，seq从1递增且next_seq大于已有最大序号。记录必须引用存在的图书和读者，不允许重复未归还记录或超库存。已有文件的缺失字段、错误类型、损坏JSON与非法引用均为storage_error，不能自动修复并覆盖。",
